#%RAML 1.0 DataType
description: |
  Where the unit price of a line came from when the order was confirmed.
  - LOCAL: the ERP local price (greater than 0).
  - LAST_PRICE: the last confirmed price of the preferred provider.
  - QUOTE: a live quote from the preferred provider.
type: string
enum: [LOCAL, LAST_PRICE, QUOTE]
example: LAST_PRICE
